{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","强袭猎矛"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","強襲の槍"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始后选定狩猎对象。主动使用时，投出狩猎之矛并引爆目标身上的裂伤。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始後、「狩猟対象」を選択。アクティブ効果：槍投擲を行い、対象が持つ切創を一気に抉る"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始4秒后，那非选定当前累计承受伤害最高的敌人作为他的“狩猎对象”，并会优先选取“狩猎对象”作为其技能目标。\n主动释放时，那非向狩猎神祈祷，投出一根必定暴击的狩猎之矛，对目标造成600% + 70% ATK的真实伤害，并在短暂延迟后引爆目标身上的裂伤，每层裂伤额外造成35% + 3.5% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始から4秒後、合計被ダメージが最も高い敵を「狩猟対象」に指定し、優先的に「狩猟対象」をスキル発動対象に選択\nアクティブ効果：狩猟の神に祈りを捧げ、クリティカル確定の槍投擲を行い、対象に600% + 70% ATKの確定ダメージを与える。短時間後、対象が持つ切創を一気に抉り、切創1スタックにつき、追加で35% + 3.5% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":95,"end":101,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":139,"end":146,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":99,"end":105,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":157,"end":164,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":91,"end":105,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":136,"end":150,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":95,"end":109,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":154,"end":168,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","狩猎之矛伤害提升至630% + 70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","槍投擲によるダメージが630% + 70% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","狩猎之矛伤害提升至660% + 70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","槍投擲によるダメージが660% + 70% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","狩猎之矛伤害提升至690% + 70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","槍投擲によるダメージが690% + 70% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","狩猎之矛伤害提升至720% + 70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","槍投擲によるダメージが720% + 70% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","猛利贯伤"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","貫通傷の痕"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","投矛暴击时对目标叠加裂伤，并在目标释放大招时引爆。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","槍投擲でクリティカルダメージを与えた時、対象に切創を付与。切創を持つ敵が必殺技を発動する時、切創のスタック数に応じてダメージを受ける"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当那非通过普通攻击或技能投掷长矛造成暴击时，额外造成目标6.5% + 0.8%初始最大生命值的伤害（最高不超过180% + 20% ATK），并削减等量最大生命值（首领模式下，不会削减最大生命值，但会将上述伤害转为真实伤害），最多削减40%，同时使目标获得5层裂伤，最多叠加30层，该效果不可被驱散。\n当带有裂伤的敌人释放终极技能时，每层裂伤使其受到35% + 3.5% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","通常攻撃または槍投擲スキルでクリティカルダメージを与えた時、追加で対象の初期HP上限×6.5% + 0.8%のダメージを与え（追加ダメージは180% + 20% ATKを超えない）、与えた追加ダメージの分、対象のHP上限が減少（1度の戦闘につき、同じ敵に対し、この方法で減少できるHP上限は最大40%まで。ボス挑戦モードの場合、ボスのHP上限は減少せず、代わりに追加ダメージを確定ダメージに変換）。さらに、対象に切創を5スタック付与（切創は最大30スタックまで重複可能、解除不可）\n切創を持つ敵が必殺技を発動する時、切創1スタックにつき、その敵は35% + 3.5% ATKのダメージを受ける"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":60,"end":66,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":179,"end":186,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":47,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":74,"end":80,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":276,"end":283,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":56,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":176,"end":190,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":70,"end":84,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":273,"end":287,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成最大生命值伤害提升至7% + 0.8%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","追加ダメージが対象のHP上限×7% + 0.8%にUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成最大生命值伤害提升至7.5% + 0.8%。"],["/